  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Evidence for Better Policy Making</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To inform and influence international and national policymakers in donor and developing countries, by producing accessible policy products and active outreach, based on the latest evidence. The priority areas of policy focus are 1. democracy support, 2. closing civic space, 3. anti-corruption, 4. conflict and violence,5. gender, 6. technology and repression, and 7. the changing global context of aid.</narrative>
  </description>
